  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v2.6.1: documentation and packaging patch - every public member now carries XML documentation (CS1591 is enforced as a build error) and the README was reviewed for accuracy; LNKDATA001 now reports only when the declared tenant column is not mapped, instead of whenever [MultiTenant] is used; [TenantKey] now supplies the tenant column at property level and [ConcurrencyToken] is honoured as a synonym of [ConcurrencyCheck], so neither attribute is a silent no-op. Previous release: v2.6.0 - richer expression surface and faster plans - column-to-column comparisons (NotEqual/GreaterThan/LessThan and their OrEqual variants), Sql.Lower/Upper/Trim/Length/Coalesce/Count/CountDistinct with per-provider function names, tenant and soft-delete predicates pushed into WHERE and into join ON clauses instead of wrapping tables in derived subqueries, Repository.FindManyAsync for chunked IN loads instead of N+1 loops, plus AnyAsync/CountAsync/ListAsync predicate overloads, StreamAsync and DeleteAsync(entity). Full documentation & release notes: https://quoclinh.id.vn/docs/linkit",
